WEBVTT

00:00.350 --> 00:04.065
devhost starts a background daemon, checks on it, and stops it.

00:04.515 --> 00:08.137
This daemon has three commands: start, status, and stop.

00:08.587 --> 00:10.120
Start the stack.

00:10.570 --> 00:13.681
devhost runs the start command and waits for the health check.

00:14.131 --> 00:16.871
The daemon answers on its HTTPS hostname.

00:19.451 --> 00:22.052
Stopping the stack runs the daemon's stop command.

00:22.502 --> 00:24.360
The daemon is no longer running.
